  - publish, host, or deploy a modified version, or present one as PA MHAD.

Why: this app explains Pennsylvania law (20 Pa.C.S. Chapter 58) and prints
legal forms. Changes made without review could give people wrong legal
information, so every change goes through the copyright holder.

